---
import { SITE, FRIEND_LINKS } from '../data/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="relative mt-28 overflow-hidden rounded-t-[2.5rem] text-paper">
  <!-- 深色底 + 内部极光辉光（夜间模式下比页面底色再深一档，保持层次） -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#17161b] dark:bg-[#101014]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute -top-44 left-[15%] size-[34rem] rounded-full bg-crimson/30 blur-[130px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-24 -bottom-56 size-[30rem] rounded-full bg-aurora-gold/20 blur-[130px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-aurora-red/70 to-transparent"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="wrap relative py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide">
          川流不息<span class="text-aurora-red">，</span>代码为舟<span class="text-aurora-gold">。</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-loose text-paper/60">
          The Brotherhood of SCU，由四川大学在校生及校友自发组织的开发者社区。
          海纳百川，有容乃大——期待与你共同书写川大开发者的故事。
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-paper/40 uppercase">Sitemap</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/blog/" class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">文章</a></li>
          <li><a href="/projects/" class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">开源项目</a></li>
          <li><a href="/members/" class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">成员名录</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about/" class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">关于我们</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-paper/40 uppercase">Contact</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a
              href={SITE.github}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">GitHub ↗</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">邮箱</a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/rss.xml" class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">RSS 订阅</a></li>
          <li>
            <a
              href={SITE.discord}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold">Discord 频道</a
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-paper/15 pt-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.25em] text-paper/40 uppercase">Links</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        {
          FRIEND_LINKS.map((l) => (
            <li>
              <a
                href={l.link}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-paper/75 transition-colors hover:text-aurora-gold"
              >
                {l.name} ↗
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>

      <div
        class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-paper/40 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
      >
        <p>© {year} The Brotherhood of SCU</p>
        <p>非官方学生组织 · 与四川大学无隶属关系</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
